Apple and @tbwamal enlisted Dua Lipa and her Radical Optimism Tour to help launch the iPhone 17 Pro with an unprecedented behind-the-scenes ‘Shot on iPhone’ campaign. 

For Apple, the project marks the first time two iPhones have starred in a single campaign, using the newly launched iPhone 17 Pro and iPhone Air to capture never-before-seen footage from sound check to encore. 

They showcased how iPhone’s most advanced camera systems turn everyone into a pro, shooting from the stands, backstage, and directly in Dua’s hands on stage to demonstrate that the nimbleness and quality of these devices provide distinctive perspectives not commonly captured with traditional equipment. 

