@toapaintthailand is an integral part of Thai life - just not in the way you’d expect.
 
To honor the brand’s immense cultural influence, @tbwathailand \Juice has launched The Life of Paint 🎨 , a visually stunning campaign that authentically documents how empty paint buckets are repurposed across communities throughout Thailand. 
 
Consisting of images taken from a year long journey through fish markets, roadside eateries, temples and more, the photographic series depicts how the TOA bucket has found new life long after its original use.

